# Ingris Stingerquill: "{4}: Create a 2/2 colorless Wizard Soldier creature token named Cadet. Then creatures you control gain
# haste until end of turn." On turn 3 Bot1 pays {4} (a Mountain, Mox Jet, Mox Ruby and Mox Pearl): the Cadet is made and then
# it and every other creature there as the ability resolves have haste; an Ornithopter cast afterwards does not, and
# is refused as an attacker beside the Cadet, which attacks the turn it was made. Ingris and the Cadet attack: two triggers
# (2 damage), then combat damage 1 + 2: Bot2 ends at 15.

